erplexed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's not that she doesn't have emotions. It's not that she is tsundere either. Rather, she is honest about her feelings and proactive from the start. Though Itsuki hasn't noticed, she intends to give off a full-on 'I love you' aura. She craves affection, but her unique sense of personal space can sometimes make her come across as a stalker to others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Translated from the official site)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91373"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情がないわけではない。別にツンデレなわけでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むしろ最初から自分の気持ちに素直で行動的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"樹には伝わっていないが、本人的には好き好きオーラ全開のつもり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えたがりだが、距離感が独特なので相手からはストーカーのように感じられることも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23198","sourceWorkId":"29680","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美術部の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・樹ひとりだった部にこの春から入部してきた新入生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入部後は毎日欠かさず部室にやってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表情が乏しく口数少なくぶっきらぼう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情が読みにくく樹は困惑気味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情がないわけではない。別にツンデレなわけでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むしろ最初から自分の気持ちに素直で行動的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"樹には伝わっていないが、本人的には好き好きオーラ全開のつもり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えたがりだが、距離感が独特なので"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相手からはストーカーのように感じられることも。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77608"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23198","sourceWorkId":"29680","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23198","sourceWorkId":"29680","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"145 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23198","sourceWorkId":"29680","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23198","sourceWorkId":"29680","sourceField":null,"scop